                <invention-title lang="de">SPIELSYSTEM, SPIELVORRICHTUNG UND SPIELSTEUERUNG ZUR VERBESSERUNG DER NUTZBARKEIT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME DE JEU, DISPOSITIF DE JEU ET CONTRÔLEUR DE JEU PERMETTANT D'AMÉLIORER LA FACILITÉ D'UTILISATION</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">GAME SYSTEM, GAME DEVICE, AND GAME CONTROLLER ALLOWING IMPROVEMENT IN USABILITY</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>It is provided an information processing apparatus capable of communicating with a game controller, the information processing apparatus comprising: a connection unit performing processing for establishing connection with the game controller in accordance with a received connection signal in accordance with at least any of an operation onto a first operation portion of the game controller and an operation onto a second operation portion of the game controller; a transmission unit transmitting, when the processing for establishing connection is completed, a request signal requesting for information on an operation time at which the operation onto the first operation portion has been performed and an operation time at which the operation onto the second operation portion has been performed, the information being stored in a storage unit of the game controller; a determination unit determining whether the operation onto the first operation portion and the operation onto the second operation portion satisfy a predetermined condition based on the information on the operation time transmitted from the game controller; a registration unit registering a first operation scheme as an operation scheme of the game controller when a result of determination by the determination unit is affirmative, the first operation scheme being a vertical holding scheme or a lateral holding scheme; and a game processing execution unit performing game processing based on at least any of a first operation signal in accordance with the operation onto the first operation portion and a second operation signal in accordance with the operation onto the second operation portion.</p>
            </abstract>
